{"id": "component/cmp-legacy-plain", "type": "component", "slug": "cmp-legacy-plain", "path": "knowledge/components/cmp-legacy-plain.md", "frontmatter": {"type": "component", "created": "2026-01-15", "updated": "2026-01-15", "draft": false, "name": "Legacy plain", "description": "The default build target runs `dotnet test Example.Tests.csproj --filter \"TestCategory = Smoke Tests\"`, and any failure fails the build. The other UI fixtures and the whole API project are built but never run by the checked-in build."}, "body": "Body."}
